# Build-context exclusions for the frontend image (audit PR-06).
#
# node_modules is the important one. Dockerfile:11 runs `COPY . .` AFTER
# `npm ci`, so without this a host node_modules (different platform, wrong
# architecture, or simply stale) overwrote the one just installed inside the
# image -- a build that succeeds locally and produces a broken image.

node_modules/
dist/
.angular/

.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.*

# Test/coverage output
coverage/

*.md
